# Images directory for notes posts

Add your post images here, organized by date or topic.

Example structure:
```
assets/images/
├── 2026-07-03-post-title/
│   ├── image1.jpg
│   └── image2.jpg
└── screenshots/
    └── feature.png
```

Then reference in your posts as:
`![Alt text]({{ site.baseurl }}/assets/images/filename.jpg)`
